  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"xlhc3\" id=\"xlhc3\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5222b17\" id=\"ue5222b17\">模块module</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u62d0d742\" id=\"u62d0d742\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaebc9682\" id=\"uaebc9682\">模块是 Python 程序架构的一个核心概念。Python中模块就是一个</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufa2247d7\" id=\"ufa2247d7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u611d4b72\" id=\"u611d4b72\">.py</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9aaedded\" id=\"u9aaedded\">文件，模块中可以定义</span><code data-lake-id=\"ue8e4f4d8\" id=\"ue8e4f4d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u23e2183f\" id=\"u23e2183f\">函数</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf48f57f0\" id=\"uf48f57f0\">，</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufabafd3c\" id=\"ufabafd3c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u25a8f7af\" id=\"u25a8f7af\">变量</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uda7ca626\" id=\"uda7ca626\">，</span><code data-lake-id=\"ua7a78cc6\" id=\"ua7a78cc6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3fa58ce\" id=\"ue3fa58ce\">类</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud9195a94\" id=\"ud9195a94\">。模块可以被其他模块引用</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"IHga9\" id=\"IHga9\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u150eae5f\" id=\"u150eae5f\">创建模块文件</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u19e1511c\" id=\"u19e1511c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u58d5c97c\" id=\"u58d5c97c\">创建文件：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u813cdf79\" id=\"u813cdf79\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5fa78e09\" id=\"u5fa78e09\">utils.py</span></code></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22utils.py%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%8F%98%E9%87%8F%20%5Cnname%20%3D%20'%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89'%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cndef%20sum(a%2Cb)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20a%2Bb%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%AE%9A%E4%B9%89%E7%B1%BB%5Cnclass%20Person%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__init__(self%2Cname%2Cage)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.name%20%3D%20name%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.age%20%3D%20age%5Cn%20%20%20%20def%20__str__(self)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20'name%3A%7B%7D%2Cage%3A%7B%7D'.format(self.name%2Cself.age)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22utils.py%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YMK7z%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"xnh6g\" id=\"xnh6g\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc3e4e749\" id=\"uc3e4e749\">导入模块中的功能</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u0b5fbb91\" id=\"u0b5fbb91\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8227db04\" id=\"u8227db04\">整体导入模块</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%5Cnimport%20utils%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E4%B8%AD%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%5Cnprint(utils.name)%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84sum%E6%96%B9%E6%B3%95%5Cnresult%20%3D%20utils.sum(10%2C20)%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BA%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97utils%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84Person%E7%B1%BB%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%5Cnp%20%3D%20utils.Person('%E5%BC%A0%E4%B8%89'%2C30)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Mbebm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ue44d963e\" id=\"ue44d963e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1846f1f1\" id=\"u1846f1f1\">导入模块中部分功能</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BB%8E%E6%A8%A1%E5%9D%97%E4%B8%AD%E5%AF%BC%E5%85%A5%E9%83%A8%E5%88%86%E5%8A%9F%E8%83%BD%5Cnfrom%20utils%20import%20name%2C%20sum%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8name%5Cnprint(name)%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8sum%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnresult%20%3D%20sum(10%2C20)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZI2zn%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u6854b5fa\" id=\"u6854b5fa\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud14617fb\" id=\"ud14617fb\">导入模块中全部功能</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20utils%20import%20*%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8name%5Cnprint(name)%5Cn%23%20%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8sum%E5%87%BD%E6%95%B0%5Cnresult%20%3D%20sum(10%2C20)%5Cn%23%20%E5%88%9B%E5%BB%BAPerson%E5%AF%B9%E8%B1%A1%5Cnp%20%3D%20Person('%E6%9E%97%E9%9D%92%E9%9C%9E'%2C60)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22a5jW4%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"DNuO7\" id=\"DNuO7\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufc210f26\" id=\"ufc210f26\">模块的导入冲突</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ucebf244f\" id=\"ucebf244f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u88439046\" id=\"u88439046\">如果两个模块中有同名的变量、函数或者类，同时引入就可能出现冲突</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u88204a16\" id=\"u88204a16\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1684894951066-d24c56de-f253-4990-a6f5-cdc82a703d44.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc04e6086-53e1-4b1f-8d3f-0f54d2f96a8%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf8a88636-e8bb-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A875%2C%22originHeight%22%3A326%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23e6e4e4%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ucfd474b7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"l0wsn\" id=\"l0wsn\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2428b1b5\" id=\"u2428b1b5\">部分导入冲突</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20hello%20import%20name%5Cnfrom%20hi%20import%20name%5Cn%5Cnprint(name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22JPzc1%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u89865838\" id=\"u89865838\"><span data-lake-id=\"u251e7ffb\" id=\"u251e7ffb\">同时引入</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud664d2a2\" id=\"ud664d2a2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0b4e2129\" id=\"u0b4e2129\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u08ca22e3\" id=\"u08ca22e3\">的话，输出的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u27edbe6c\" id=\"u27edbe6c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1eded626\" id=\"u1eded626\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u77986930\" id=\"u77986930\">是</span><code data-lake-id=\"ud8cee797\" id=\"ud8cee797\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4d953bc9\" id=\"u4d953bc9\">hi</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub7d5e95d\" id=\"ub7d5e95d\">中的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u729c7e44\" id=\"u729c7e44\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc965095c\" id=\"uc965095c\">name</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub52917a7\" id=\"ub52917a7\">，是有顺序的</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u7bae0f92\" id=\"u7bae0f92\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc7c4043d\" id=\"uc7c4043d\">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud17beb12\" id=\"ud17beb12\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf36805da\" id=\"uf36805da\">局部引入冲突解决方案</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"ud5ae2136\" id=\"ud5ae2136\"><span data-lake-id=\"u758cb9dc\" id=\"u758cb9dc\">可以通过</span><code data-lake-id=\"u294d1188\" id=\"u294d1188\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6ab89e51\" id=\"u6ab89e51\">as</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub0e8837e\" id=\"ub0e8837e\"> 给功能起别名</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20hello%20import%20name%20as%20hello_name%5Cnfrom%20hi%20import%20name%20as%20hi_name%5Cn%5Cnprint(hello_name)%5Cnprint(hi_name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22A0Ocp%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"CbEK1\" id=\"CbEK1\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1dd11e8c\" id=\"u1dd11e8c\">全部导入冲突</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20hello%20import%20*%5Cnfrom%20hi%20import%20*%5Cn%5Cnprint(name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VqG2o%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2c233a17\" id=\"u2c233a17\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9b5c629\" id=\"ub9b5c629\">同样输出的是hi中的name属性</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u79387291\" id=\"u79387291\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucbb941b2\" id=\"ucbb941b2\">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uf70b01b6\" id=\"uf70b01b6\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u73471624\" id=\"u73471624\">全部引入冲突解决方案</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"udb61e3a5\" id=\"udb61e3a5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c01b70e\" id=\"u5c01b70e\">直接引入模块</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22import%20hello%5Cnimport%20hi%5Cn%5Cnprint(hello.name)%5Cnprint(hi.name)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MQTSY%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h2 data-lake-id=\"ytFTY\" id=\"ytFTY\" data-lake-index-type=\"2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua5f77401\" id=\"ua5f77401\">模块的内置变量</span><code data-lake-id=\"u0dc81c39\" id=\"u0dc81c39\"><span data-lake-id=\"u93faee06\" id=\"u93faee06\">__name__</span></code></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u9e7740da\" id=\"u9e7740da\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u36059e81\" id=\"u36059e81\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc16c41fb\" id=\"uc16c41fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8dee574c\" id=\"u8dee574c\">__name__</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u17cadfc6\" id=\"u17cadfc6\">是模块